{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "fa7e6e997ae58ba94ea521f497bf4c3ce45f70f238fa3929d1a51b17c2187068", "ja": "お姫さまの憧れ", "zh": "公主的憧憬", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "30604a76b7651513e10dde2dc5a2dce3149192e9be83779ae0c663fa2b3a9efb", "ja": "撮影会の準備をしながら、昴はアイドルに\nなってから兄達の態度が変わったとぼやく。\nプロデューサーから昴と同じで戸惑っている\nだけと告げられる。これからアイドルに慣れ\nていくためにも全力投球を誓うのだった。", "zh": "昴一边准备摄影会，一边抱怨说自己成为偶像后，哥哥们的态度变了。制作人告诉她，哥哥们只是和昴一样感到不知所措。为了今后也能逐渐适应偶像生活，她发誓要全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0782e5e6cc75350ed214a0b6319e5b11bb3f932149f55b870061fc8455409b52", "ja": "撮影会に向けて準備中のある日……", "zh": "为了拍摄会正在准备的某一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "31f962f288e91c0a3f8b831f6d4eca5957fc5532dadc402562745574fea26901", "ja": "なるほど。昴は撮影会で、ファンとキャッチボールを\nする企画か……うん、悪くないと思う！", "zh": "原来如此。昴要在摄影会上和粉丝玩传接球的活动啊……嗯，我觉得不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "2467182b459d0d40bbd8d53cba6d786a0e9ca62a75508dee700b48575b9e8fd5", "ja": "マジで！？　思いつきだったけど、\n言ってみるもんだな～。", "zh": "真的！？虽然只是临时想到的，但果然还是该说出来啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "c61c8be5f000b5b5f119261094edeaeb2508714de1d28d1d4bb06ddd0aa30eba", "ja": "投球シーンも撮影映えするし、なにより昴らしい！\n当日はお客さんのグローブも用意しておかないとな。", "zh": "投球场景也很上镜，更重要的是，这很有昴的风格！当天也得准备好给观众用的手套才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "fede84928517e4e51148d07cd054f6d623fcbc782b4f9a190dcd388262c5054e", "ja": "やったぜ！　それじゃオレも、うちで練習……\nあ、もう無理か。劇場でやるしかないかなー。", "zh": "太棒了！那我也在家里练习……\n啊，已经不行了。看来只能在剧场练习了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "95dd060b7cf527961d4f398a1d438a45550858a767885e1bbd7aa7ca9a3d25bd", "ja": "？　どうしてだ？\n確か、昴にはお兄さんがいるはずだよな？", "zh": "？为什么？昴不是应该有哥哥吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "4c9efc36ffc82afb15cbd65235f8b570668b0e1d839826655a78c57aeeabeeac", "ja": "ああ、4人いるぜ。\nみんな野球好きだし、経験もあるんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，有4人呢。\n大家都喜欢棒球，也都有经验，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "22778a3925cdd99ab540884d0c50573247d99e72c4224330c45342f1431a236e", "ja": "オレがアイドルになってから「ケガしたら大変だ」\nとか言ってキャッチボールしてくれないんだよ！", "zh": "自从我成为偶像后，他们就总说“要是受伤了就糟糕了”，不肯陪我玩接球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "b889104e70e9566ea00ff784a66374315fb8d5bac1262cb2b401811638a79b00", "ja": "……へぇ？　そうなんだ？", "zh": "……诶？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "2a7a01e14b7031735f1459b3a4c1dbf3b4c169df06351000cddce23b95711fb0", "ja": "ミョーに構ってくるようになって、「送り迎え、\n本当にいらないのか？」とか聞いてくるし……。", "zh": "他最近变得特别爱管我，还会问“接送真的不用吗？”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "347489eaf7cff1310f580693f705665070b19834814de491ac305eb4da7bbccb", "ja": "デビューする前は「昴にアイドルなんて\nできるのか～？」ってからかってきたくせにさ！", "zh": "明明在我出道前还嘲笑我说：“昴能当偶像吗～？”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "28c293cd1a2783e8225810557f82e6634c6f110b09e2440a7bf5de50bd1c3f71", "ja": "あはは、仲のいい兄妹なんだな。", "zh": "啊哈哈，你们兄妹感情真好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "8b723f1d9329108fe54a6cd7acc7875b7dbc68a4ac61c4ef0b6c2fc0bc8663dd", "ja": "あ、なんだよそれ！　まつりにも言われたんだよな～。\nそりゃ、仲悪くはないけどさ～。", "zh": "啊，那是什么啊！之前也被茉莉这么说过啊～。\n我们关系也不算差啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "2b20ae6db046e9cd6c7971c67846d4d740e91e9979874ef8cfdb738094bc3377", "ja": "お兄さん達は、\nもともとアイドルが好きな方なのか？", "zh": "你哥哥们本来就喜欢偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "a25c2211d0d6f078d63cf5dda07f14e6d560db558f66e0adcc232a43c71270e2", "ja": "え？　うん、小さい頃からテレビでよく見てたぜ。\nそれを隣で見てて、オレも好きになったんだよなー。", "zh": "诶？嗯，我从小就经常在电视上看。  \n在旁边看着看着，我也喜欢上了嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "78b0abbb117b9b58a548b12b1e938aa0a067aa6ecf352312f0b1cfee6ab5a749", "ja": "かわいい子って、すっげーかわいいんだもん！\nしかもかわいい服着て歌ってさ。もう無敵じゃん！", "zh": "可爱的女孩子本来就超级可爱嘛！  \n而且还穿着可爱的衣服唱歌，那不就是无敌了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "368505d05287edeb34b8129ee3c1214c7f9d3d6ffbc446d427ebf53b99feabf5", "ja": "……その時の無敵にかわいいアイドルに、\n今は昴がなってるんだぞ？", "zh": "……而那个时候无敌可爱的那位偶像，\n现在不就是昴你本人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "669caab9287564c15d57a9cedb3b9b2473e707966974410e93d44a55e78afafd", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうだけど……、まだデビューした\nばっかだし、そこまでじゃないっつーか……。", "zh": "诶！？是、是这样没错……但我才刚出道，还没到那种程度啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "633b637a31185a1bd6528e65bb9f3794688cc6a1f97e5cf4b7ccc0f8363bba9a", "ja": "もー、ヘンなこと言うなよー！\nハズいだろーっ！？", "zh": "真是的，别说奇怪的话啦——！\n很不好意思的好不好——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "8384b93648f66fa0fd47341a51270230343c75f22e9689eec933aec02cd5f4a1", "ja": "ははっ、ごめんごめん。でも、きっと昴と同じように\nお兄さん達もハズいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。不过，哥哥们肯定也和昴一样觉得害羞吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "b53a2e7376ea99ffdaa113b902423a37261eea3577691feb67a7917c78b55fee", "ja": "え？　兄ちゃんたちも？", "zh": "诶？哥哥们也是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "9efc75dbe0fe784c681b00212fb42c4b1d393b7772f969a335335c66675668b5", "ja": "隣で一緒にアイドルに憧れてた妹が、いきなり\nアイドルになったんだ。そりゃあ戸惑うよな？", "zh": "一直在身边和我一起憧憬着成为偶像的妹妹，突然一下子成了偶像。那肯定会让人不知所措吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "13ba781c450036046909ee00a143332f2bfde855c4fff4fb3b06668a2bbf2543", "ja": "あ……そっか。そうだよな。\nなにしろ、オレがまだ戸惑ってるし。", "zh": "啊……这样啊。确实是这样。\n毕竟，我现在还在困惑呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "0a7c46cb785ca3a4a3cb0e9a542b1e748c686c11042a4f74ad5ea67d6f5ccc4e", "ja": "プロデューサーと出会って、なんかうまいこと言われて\nドサマギでアイドルになったよーなもんだからなー。", "zh": "和制作人相遇后，被他说了些挺会哄人的话，稀里糊涂地就成了偶像，差不多就是这么回事吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "3abffcfe2962008d37ac057412d14d73700e31f93ea8b8a5f953461ce50a4c2c", "ja": "い、いや、ちゃんと説明したし、納得してくれたよな？\nまだ慣れてないとは思うけどっ。", "zh": "不、不是，我明明好好解释过了，你也接受了吧？虽然我想你还没习惯就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "d5a945b5af6973353c668d7c0d230664a6323e586ceeb7626515dfdd60f7a9b3", "ja": "まあ、だから、これから慣れていくんだと思うよ。\n昴もお兄さん達も、憧れの、アイドルの『永吉昴』に。", "zh": "哎呀，所以，我觉得之后就会慢慢习惯的。\n无论是昴还是哥哥们，都会习惯成为憧憬的、偶像的“永吉昴”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "767edb618496bdb05e4755a327426aeec7256b42b7041645f14bd9732a6a4db0", "ja": "……。\nアイドルの、オレ……。", "zh": "……。\n作为偶像的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "0a68be83095d23ec5304b00bfac463dd4364141f6128042b7def2c09aac1d4e5", "ja": "それも、きっとすぐに。\nそんなに時間はかからないんじゃないかな。", "zh": "那件事也一定很快就能实现。应该不会花太长时间吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "80656010eb8d9996f47e716d26503290c8f09c7ab83bcf7123353c9d222394c6", "ja": "え？　そ、そうか？\nオレ、わりとまだ全然な気がするけど……。", "zh": "诶？是、是吗？\n我倒觉得自己好像还差得远呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "a23cfd52e8be49139977fa4ae44e4299a8664c7f10faeb0206de5335497a66cc", "ja": "でも、昴はもうお姫さまだろ？\n童話のお姫さまとは、少し違うかもしれないけど。", "zh": "不过，昴已经是公主了吧？\n\n虽然可能和童话里的公主有一点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "3b34e403272c8d1ece74ed4bf575c09d0d69880a8587ff560d275c1126537550", "ja": "ステージでは自分らしく、のびのびと輝いてる。\nTeam6thの、立派な5人のお姫さまの1人だ！", "zh": "在舞台上，她以自己的风格自在地闪耀着。她可是Team6th优秀的5位公主中的1位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "1eefdcd02255774be4cea243dd9052a89f9b81296de25107ebeda725c30c8231", "ja": "そ……そっか。まあデビューに向けて、みんなで\nお姫さまの特訓とかしたから……そうなのかも！", "zh": "这……这样啊。对了，为了出道，大家一起进行了公主特训……所以，或许真是这样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "1e9f8c62a33fad67da16b903c04481766f1328a47b9b24f9f9befe433c8cf3a4", "ja": "うん、そんな昴を、これからもどんどん見せていこう。\n昴らしく、お姫さまに……アイドルに、全力投球で！", "zh": "嗯，今后也要不断展现出这样的昴才行。\n保持昴的风格，化身公主……全力以赴做好偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "50ac7a2cdd2008f23a62104a3a760ea6e6fd6f4e97c87fc165b4c6e6874e35be", "ja": "そしたらお兄さん達にも絶対に伝わるよ。\n昴は昴のままで、でも、アイドルなんだって。", "zh": "这样一来，哥哥们也一定能明白的。昴就是昴，但也是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "f0f5622aa90b0bed5b8d215a16bbca534c28b1e35c8a39af29936b69e9034bcd", "ja": "きっと、昴自身にもな！", "zh": "肯定也一定能传达给昴自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1035_047sub", "source_sha256": "97934caf27812a93d3f1bdaf7303c7c4b69f52e3f6d958cff31d91e87de8dc93", "ja": "……へへっ、ありがと。なんか、スッキリした！\nサンキュ、プロデューサー！", "zh": "……嘿嘿，谢谢你。感觉整个人都轻松了！\n谢啦，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "8f0c29ebaa6232ac4a479c32389a5c8400b79022f33112c78ae6f4249ea23f53", "ja": "よーし、そうと決まれば、オレはオレのままで、\nお姫さまで、かわいいアイドル目指して……！", "zh": "好——既然决定了，那我就做我自己，以公主的身份，朝着可爱的偶像目标前进……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_03_1037_047sub", "source_sha256": "6195dbad5eabc1c9c908b12feb08bb7c1b0cf80e084735bb5bbbc10c2afd59c2", "ja": "今から全力で投げ込みだ！\nプロデューサー、オレの全力投球、受けてくれよな！", "zh": "从现在开始就要全力投球！\n制作人，接下我这全力投出的一球吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
